tps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119689.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-25T16:23:26Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119664\r\n\r\nCurrently, IK treats the bone pose that is not executing IK as the rest pose. This behavior need to be maintained because, as shown in the example https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119664#issuecomment-4522567706, it performs processing such as a Pole Target that directs the root toward a secondary target (in other words, it changes the IK constraint axis with other SkeletonModifiers before the IK processing).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis does not solve the problem, but the documentation needs to be corrected because it does not match the current actual behavior.\r\n\r\nIn the future:\r\n\r\n- The Gizmo needs to be fixed\r\n- The documentation should be changed to indicate that the pose retrieved depends on the option after adding an option to set limits to the rest standard, like `The bone pose refers to \"the pose immediately before IK processing\" or \"the rest\" depend on the option.`\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo